// DisplayHelp :
"P3035053533" "You have Mastery over Ice and Cold to control your foes and to add some much needed armor and defense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Snow Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4107230931" "Snow Storm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1849705065" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Speed, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P384020691" "While active, the chill from this Snow Storm can dramatically Slow the attack and movement speed of the target and all nearby foes. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P94096402" "You Slow the attack and movement speed of all nearby foes with your {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1490875287" "-SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2093128173" "The Snow Storm has reduced your Attack rate and Running speed."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P115947258" "{PlayerSource} Slows you with his {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flash Freeze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P889361091" "Flash Freeze"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1242338930" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DMG(Cold/Lethal), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P574642158" "You can Flash Freeze a large patch of ground beneath a targeted foe, instantly forming dozens of deadly ice shards that do Cold damage to all enemies in the area. The victims are left trapped within the icicles, but can break free if disturbed. Only targets near the ground can be affected. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3472027048" "Sleep"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2439637276" "The Flash Freeze has rendered you Unconscious."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1059044119" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of lethal damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2221891402" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of cold damage to {PlayerDest}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frozen Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3142488911" "Frozen Armor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2605655468" "Self, +Def(Smash, Lethal), +Res(Cold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3046466752" "While this power is active, you coat yourself in rock hard Frozen Armor. The hardness of the Frozen Armor offers good defense to Smashing and Lethal attack as well as reduces Cold damage. Also, Fire attacks deal slightly less damage. You must have Snow Storm or Flash Freeze before selecting this power. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P484090270" "You are now more defensive to smashing and lethal attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hibernate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1870821033" "Hibernate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3368750259" "Toggle: Self +Regeneration, +Recovery, Invulnerable; Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2571786986" "When you activate this power, you encase yourself in a block of solid ice, making yourself invulnerable, though you are frozen solid and cannot act. While Hibernating within this block of ice, you heal damage and Recover Endurance at an incredible rate. You can emerge at will by deactivating the power, but you cannot Hibernate for more than 30 seconds. If you activate this power while in the air, you will fall. You must have two other Cold Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2677645364" "You Hibernate in a block of ice, and are almost completely invulnerable while you heal at an astonishing rate."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Electrical Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P570363058" "Electrical Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2607018877" "You have Mastery over Electrical power to defeat your foes, and to add some much needed armor and defense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Static Discharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2901832587" "Static Discharge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3892317725" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Energy), -END"
// Power Help Text :
"P43660505" "Discharges a cone of Static Electricity that deals damage and drains Endurance from all affected foes in the area. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3385120024" "Your {PowerName} electrocutes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
