// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2154700027" "Your {PowerName} drains some endurance from {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1318363829" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with his {PowerName} and drains some of your Endurance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shocking Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2651575508" "Shocking Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3713900758" "Ranged, Minor DoT(Energy), Foe Hold, -END"
// Power Help Text :
"P3969516616" "Holds a distant foe by Shocking him with electricity. The seized target is left writhing in agony and is unable to defend himself. Shocking Bolt also drains a some Endurance from the target over time. A portion of drained Endurance may be returned to you. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3859267840" "DoT(Energy), Hold"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3211993838" "You are being held and are on fire."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1562254593" "You electrocute {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2252229434" "{PlayerSource} electrocutes you for {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1051884142" "You recover some of the Endurance you drained."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Charged Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P571716827" "Charged Armor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3265949263" "Toggle: Self +Res(Smash, Lethal, Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P128895497" "When you toggle on this power, you are surrounded in a charged field that makes you highly resistant to Smashing, Lethal and Energy damage. You must have Static Discharge or Shocking Bot before selecting this power. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P631656156" "Your {PowerName} has made you highly resistant to smashing and lethal damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EM Pulse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P987369644" "EM Pulse"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3531060777" "PBAoE, Foe Disorient, -END, -Regen, Special vs. Robots; Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P529056353" "You can unleash a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy. This EMP can affect machines, and is even powerful enough to affect synaptic brain patterns.  It will drain the Endurance and HP Regeneration of all affected targets and leave them incapacitated and Disoriented for a while. Additionally, most machines and robots will take moderate high damage. However, this power uses a lot of Endurance and leaves you unable to recover Endurance for a while. You must have two other Electrical Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2301064460" "Disorient, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P463220775" "You are Disoriented by the EMP Pulse and your Regeneration Rate is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2753580196" "Your {PowerName} Disorients and Immobilizes {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1102804825" "Your {PowerName} drains {PlayerDest} of some Endurance."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1746676435" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2665432657" "Your {PowerName} has left you exhausted!"

