// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P878115326" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Fire), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2330182960" "Incapacitates a distant foe by Charring him with smoldering soot and cinders. The target is left helpless, choking on the soot. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
