// Power : Fire Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1503020951" "Fire Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3104420862" "Toggle: Self +Res(Fire, Lethal, Smash, Cold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P446797101" "While this power is active, you get a good resistance to Lethal, Smashing and Fire damage. Fire Shield also provides minimal resistance to Cold damage. You must have Bonfire or Char before selecting this power. Recharge: Very Fast"
