// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2039826637" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DMG(Smash), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P3280820098" "Launches a Sleep Grenade at long range from beneath the barrel of your Assault Rifle. This small blast does minor smashing damage but affects all foes within the blast radius, and can knock them back. You must have Body Armor or Cryo Freeze Ray before selecting this power. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
