// Power Help Text :
"P2995278431" "This powerful stomp can cause a seismic disturbance. This will crack the Earth itself and send a Fault towards a targeted foe.  Affected targets take moderate damage and may be thrown in the air and possibly Disoriented. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
