// Power Help Text :
"P2377095891" "Your skin becomes stone while this power is active. Stone Armor makes you highly resistant to Smashing and Lethal attacks. They are less likely to land and affect you. You must have Hurl Boulder or Fissure before selecting this power. Recharge: Fast"

