// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3382744836" "Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P3976465613" "You are so connected to the Earth, you can draw upon its power to add to your own health. Activating this power increases your maximum Hit Points, and grants you resistance to Toxic Damage. You must have two other Stone Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Very Long"
