// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P183208535" "Power Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1631766390" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3308786986" "A much more powerful, yet slower version of Power Bolt. Power Blast sends a focused beam of energy at a foe that can knock him back. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2694015104" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1687926124" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4186582336" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Conserve Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2460757215" "Conserve Power"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2089016955" "Self Endurance Discount"
// Power Help Text :
"P3020419906" "You can focus for a moment to Conserve your Endurance. After activating this power, you expend less Endurance on all other powers for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1134376642" "Your concentrate and Conserve your Power.  Your powers now cost less Endurance for a while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temp Invulnerability 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3097921485" "When you toggle on this power, you become highly resistant to Smashing and Lethal damage. You must have Power Blast or Conserve Power before selecting this power. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Boost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P314575027" "Power Boost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3047510863" "Self +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2399336161" "Greatly boosts the secondary effects of your powers. Your powers effects like Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Knockbacks and more, are all improved. The effects of Power Boost last a short while, and only the next couple of attacks will be boosted. You must have two other Primal Forces Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3834136190" "You tap into your inner power and boost the abilities of your next few attacks."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Psionic Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1773904258" "Psionic Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3673575170" "You have Mastery over Psionics and the mind to blast your foes, increase your power, and to add some much needed armor and defense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mental Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2292978182" "Mental Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2707916763" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Psionic), Target -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P915789469" "This basic attack does moderate Psionic damage, and can slightly reduce a target's attack speed. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3214140212" "-Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2155086636" "Your Attack rate is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P458129897" "Your {PowerName} rips the mind of {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of psionic damage and Slows his attack speed!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2929122759" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Psionic damage and slows your attack speed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Indomitable Will 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4268714550" "Indomitable Will"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2691525548" "Self Res( Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear). DEF(Psionics)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2811014407" "Activating this power greatly boosts your resistance to Sleep, Disorient, Fear and Hold effects for 90 seconds. Indomitable Will also grants a high defense to Psionic based attacks. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4005305938" "Your {PowerName} protects you from Immobilization, Sleep, Disorient, and Hold effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mind Over Body 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2948774010" "Mind Over Body"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2207717524" "Toggle: Self +Res(Smash, Lethal, Psionics)"
// Power Help Text :
"P489050530" "When you toggle on this power, you empower your Mind Over Body to become highly resistant to Smashing, Lethal and Psionic damage. You must have Mental Blast or Indomitable Will before selecting this power. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Psionic Tornado 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1282813950" "Psionic Tornado"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1737092425" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DoT(Psionic), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P2420284978" "Unleashes a whirlwind of Psionic energy on a target, tossing nearby foes into the air. The Psionic Tornado damages foes and Slows their attack speed. You must have two other Psionic Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P786987390" "DoT(Psionic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2035661399" "You are taking damage from the Psionic Tornado."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P819825319" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of damage and Slow him!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Dark Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3397489959" "Dark Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1890358854" "You have Mastery over Darkness to weaken your foes, and to add some much needed defense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Oppressive Gloom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4259874860" "Oppressive Gloom"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1601450196" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe Disorient, Self -HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P4009417249" "The Netherworld has many mutable properties, such as the Oppressive Gloom. This power allows you to use your own Hit Points to keep enemies near you Disoriented and unable to use any powers. Endurance cost for this is minimal, but the power can be dangerous to use. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4105726681" "You are Disoriented."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2028382176" "Your {PowerName} drains you for {Damage} points of damage to keep your opponent Disoriented!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Consumption 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3604985100" "Dark Consumption"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3664607997" "PBAoE Moderate DMG(Negative), Self +End"
// Power Help Text :
"P670170653" "The dark power of the Netherworld allows you to tap the essence of your foe's soul and transfer it to yourself. This will drain the Hit Points of your enemy and add to your Endurance. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1697401567" "{PowerName} deals {Damage} points of negative energy damage to {PlayerDest} to increase your Endurance."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P793609400" "You land a critical hit with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P2440464263" "CRITICAL"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3999374117" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with his {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Embrace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3063295318" "Dark Embrace"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1918436433" "Toggle: Self +Res(Smash, Lethal, Negative, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3838696757" "You tap into the energy of the Netherworld to protect yourself from damage. This Dark Embrace shrouds you and grants resistance to Lethal, Smashing, Toxic, and Negative Energy damage. You must have Oppressive Gloom or Dark Consumption before selecting this power. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2437032337" "Your {PowerName} protects you from lethal, smashing, toxic and negative energy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Drain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2786855971" "Soul Drain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4285314984" "PBAoE Moderate DMG(Negative), Self +DMG, +ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P894742986" "Using this power, you can drain the essence of all nearby foes' souls, thus increasing your own strength. Each affected foe will lose some Hit Points and add to your Damage and Accuracy. You must have two other Dark Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2439648564" "Your {PowerName} steals {Damage} points of life from the soul of {PlayerDest} to increase your power!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Power Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1566260606" "Power Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P147179706" "You have Mastery over Power and Energy to defeat your foes, increase your power, and to add some much needed armor and defense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Conserve Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1665022061" "Power Build Up"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2834370322" "Self +DMG, +ACC, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1017491608" "Your mastery of power and energy allows you to greatly increase the damage you deal for a few seconds, as well as slightly increasing your Accuracy  Additionally, Power Build Up greatly boosts the secondary effects of your powers. Your powers effects like Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Knockbacks and more, are all improved. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3117986697" "You tap into your inner power and boost the strength of your next few powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temp Invulnerability 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1045655372" "When you toggle on this power, you become highly resistant to Smashing and Lethal damage. You must have Conserve Power or Power Build Up before selecting this power. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Total Focus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P479970076" "Total Focus"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3079084185" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1334640647" "Total Focus is complete mastery over Energy Melee. This is a very slow, but incredibly devastating attack that can knock out most opponents, leaving them Disoriented. Due to the exhausting nature of Total Focus, recharge time is very long. You must have two other Power Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P951999692" "The devastation of your {PowerName} deals a whopping {Damage} points of smashing Damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P503314699" "The devastation of your {PowerName} deals an additional whopping {Damage} points of energy Damage to {PlayerDest}."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Psychic Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P805535898" "Psychic Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1392450528" "Your Psychic Mastery allows you to dominate and control your foes, and to add some much needed defense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dominate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1898196680" "Dominate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P237929186" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Psionic), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2698584595" "Painfully tears at the mind of a single foe. Dominate deals Psionic damage and renders a foe helpless, lost in his own mind and unable to defend himself. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3096940318" "You have been Dominated and cannot act."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3628030904" "You Dominate {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Psionic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P310874651" "{PlayerSource} Dominates you for {Damage} points of Psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mass Hypnosis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1476679299" "Mass Hypnosis"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3125035697" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P1818379305" "Hypnotizes a group of foes at a distance and puts them to Sleep. The targets will remain asleep for some time, but will awaken if attacked. This power deals no damage, but if done discreetly, the targets will never be aware of your presence. Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mind Over Body 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3205200566" "When you toggle on this power, you empower your Mind Over Body to become highly resistant to Smashing, Lethal and Psionic damage. You must have Dominate or Mass Hypnosis before selecting this power. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Telekinesis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P289841888" "Telekinesis"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P488012662" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Hold, Repel"
// Power Help Text :
"P3909606314" "Lifts a foe, and any nearby foes, off the ground and repels them.  The targets are helpless, unable to take action, and will continue to hover away, picking up any passing targets, as long as you keep this power active. Keeping up this level of concentration costs a lot of Endurance. You must have two other Psychic Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4182303717" "You move {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1128839865" "{PlayerSource} uses {PowerName} to control you."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2335203856" "You are being held helpless by Telekinesis."

// ******************************************************************************** 
