// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P590027019" "Electricity Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4158469259" "You have Mastery over Electricity to defeat your foes, and to add some much needed armor and defense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Electric Fence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1082437617" "Electric Fence"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3536834546" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe Immobilize, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1283732797" "Surrounds and Immobilizes a single target in an Electric Fence. Deals some damage over time and slowly drains some Endurance. Useful for keeping villains at bay. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1433855085" "DoT(Energy), Immobilize"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P95960894" "You are Immobilized by an Electric Fence and taking damage over time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thunder Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1363030893" "Thunder Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2791213138" "Melee (AoE), High DMG(Smash, Energy), Foe Disorient, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P4018294709" "A massive attack. You smash your foes with all the power of a lightning bolt. The pummeled victim takes tremendous damage and may be Disoriented. Any nearby foes may be knocked down and take some damage from the shockwave. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1393763693" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of smashing Damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3520629726" "{PlayerSource} pummels you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1354998770" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of energy Damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2482875288" "The explosion from Thunder Strike blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Charged Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P4270215962" "When you toggle on this power, you are surrounded in a charged field that makes you highly resistant to Smashing, Lethal and Energy damage. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Sink 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2664724052" "Power Sink"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3080198159" "PBAoE, Self +End, Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3001366297" "Power Sink leeches energy directly from the bodies of all nearby foes, draining their Endurance. Each foe you draw energy from increases your Endurance. If there are no foes within range, you will not gain any Endurance. You must have two other Electricity Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2636688992" "{PowerName} steals some Endurance from {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3264726269" "Your {PowerName} increases your Endurance!"

