// Power Set : Body Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3746332825" "Body Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2754365290" "You have Mastery over Body to increase your power and even hurl energy at your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Conserve Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Focused Accuracy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4148086331" "Focused Accuracy"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1916532465" "Toggle: Self +ACC, +Perception, Res(DeBuff ToHit)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1756401964" "When this power is activated, the Hero focuses his senses to dramatically improve his accuracy. Additionally, Focused Accuracy increase your Perception, allowing you to better see stealthy foes. It also grants you resistance to powers that DeBuff your Accuracy. Focused Accuracy is a toggle power and must be activated and deactivated manually. Like all toggle powers, while active, Focused Accuracy drains Endurance while active. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2534745051" "Your {PowerName} increases your accuracy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Laser Beam Eyes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P29026730" "Laser Beam Eyes"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4021409771" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3035336578" "You can emit Laser Beams from your eyes, dealing moderate Energy damage. This attack can reduce the target's Defense. You must have Conserve Power or Focused Accuracy before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P373215750" "-DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3421292544" "Your Defense has been reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1894209503" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2802152503" "You land a critical hit with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2535907671" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with his {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Energy Torrent 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
