"P3998261018" "Energy Torrent"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1179953033" "Ranged (Cone), Minor DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P2490114018" "Energy Torrent unleashes a cone of powerful energy that can smash foes and possibly send them flying. You must have two other Body Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2839943724" "You slam {PlayerDest} to the floor deal {Damage} points of smashing damage with your {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2764143754" "You slam {PlayerDest} to the floor deal {Damage} points of energy damage with your {PowerName}."

