"P1108646357" "You have Mastery over Darkness to control and blast your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Torrent 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P326798890" "Torrent"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P326505769" "Ranged (Cone), Minor DMG(Smashing), Foe -ACC, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P2096942640" "You summon a wave of mire that sweeps away foes within its arc. The attack deals minimal Negative Energy damage, but sends foes flying and reduces their Accuracy. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
