"P369601562" "Dark Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P561405518" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P589410732" "A long range blast of dark energy. Deals moderate Negative Energy damage and reduces the target's Accuracy. You must have Torrent or Petrifying Gaze before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1866737137" "Your Accuracy has been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
