// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tenebrous Tentacles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2726905308" "Tenebrous Tentacles"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2254400840" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Negative/Smash), Foe Immobilize, -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P2310564989" "You can create a cone shaped rift to the Netherworld that allows its native creatures to slip their oily Tentacles into our reality. These creatures will snare all foes within range, Immobilizing them while the Tentacles drain their life and reduce their Accuracy. You must have two other Darkness Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P636577031" "Immobilize, -ACC"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2406217298" "The Tenebrous Tentacles are holding you in place and reducing your Accuracy."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1513428947" "Your {PowerName} entangles {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3534711131" "{PowerName} entangles you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3246588449" "Your {PowerName} entangles {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces his accuracy!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2449315823" "{PowerName} entangles you for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces your accuracy!"

