"P1188616811" "Weapon Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3131182314" "Devices are equipment you have constructed for use in combat. By using them strategically, you can gain a great tactical advantage. Traps, non-lethal munitions, and demolitions are available in this power set."

