"P1845709286" "Shuriken"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1884795216" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2635815373" "A classic small throwing weapon, you can throw Shurikens at a pretty fast fire rate. You must have Web Grenade or Caltrops before selecting this power. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2552566898" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal Damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3862632471" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3728178801" "You land a critical hit with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
