"P735711430" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P223306607" "This small throwing star is rigged to explode on impact. You must have two other Weapon Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"

