// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Energy Torrent 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P745560165" "Energy Torrent unleashes a cone of powerful energy that can smash foes and possibly send them flying. You must have two other Energy Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Pyre Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P426294712" "Pyre Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3594955472" "You have Mastery over Fire and Flame to blast your foes and control your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ring of Fire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P896308763" "Ring of Fire"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P369354458" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Fire), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P1842740470" "Immobilizes your target in a Ring of Fire. Deals some damage over time. Useful for keeping villains at bay. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3790181359" "DoT(Fire), Immobilize."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2753001443" "The Ring of Fire is keeping you immobile and burring you."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3544593565" "Your {PowerName} burns {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of fire damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1925622485" "{PlayerSource} burns you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Char 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4201439622" "Ranged, Minor DoT(Fire), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2438042740" "Incapacitates a distant foe by Charring him with smoldering soot and cinders. The target is left helpless, choking on the soot. The target will take some fire damage from char, but the damage is very trivial. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3545670080" "Sends a Blast of Fire at a targeted foe and sets the target on fire for a short period of time. Slower recharge rate than Flares, but more damage. You must have Ring of Fire or Char before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3423146141" "DoT(Fire)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3754881232" "You re on fire!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Ball 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3846694177" "Hurls an exploding Fireball that consumes a targeted foe, and all nearby enemies. Anyone in that explosion is burned and set ablaze. You must have two other Pyre Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Arctic Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2976872254" "Arctic Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2203857032" "You have Mastery over Ice and snow to blast your foes and control your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chilblain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2787247941" "Chilblain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1689686328" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Cold), Foe Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P4120815874" "Immobilizes your target in an icy trap. Deals some damage over time and slightly Slows the target's attack and movement speed. Useful for keeping villains at bay. Damage: Moderate(DoT),  Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1003436427" "DoT(Cold), Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3906732180" "The Chilblain is damaging you and holding you in place.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3531357424" "Your {PowerName} freezes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of cold damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P378872091" "{PlayerSource} freezes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of cold damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Block of Ice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3118204850" "Block of Ice"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3570542779" "Ranged, Foe Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3593956306" "You can freeze a single foe in a Block of Ice. The target is frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. More powerful foes may not be held, but all affected targets will be Slowed. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1499572515" "-Recharge, -SPD, HOLD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P294468866" "You have been frozen in a large Block of Ice.  Once free, your Attack Rate and Running speed will be reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2491454990" "You freeze {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of cold damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1953486956" "{PlayerSource} freeze you for {Damage} points of Cold damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1828207605" "Ice Blast hurls shards of ice at foes and Slows their attacks and movement for a time. Slower recharge than Ice Bolt, but more damage. You must have Chilblain or Block of Ice before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1893360687" "The Ice Blast has reduced your Attack rate and Running speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1050294889" "Shred your foes with this Ice Storm. This power deals a lot of damage in a large area and can Slow all affected targets movement and attack speed. You must have two other Arctic Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2155113270" "DoT(Cold), -Recharge, -SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4019178904" "The Ice Storm is freezing you and reducing your Attack rate and Running speed."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Earth Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2643949010" "Earth Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P185327104" "You have Mastery over Earth and stone to crush your foes and control your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stone Prison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1247417221" "Stone Prison"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P153652083" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -DEF, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2944472620" "Immobilizes a single target within an earthy formation and deals some Smashing damage over time. Some more resilient foes may require multiple attacks to Immobilize. Stone Prison can also reduce a target's Defense. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P126905658" "Dot(Smash), Immobilize, -Fly, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P114110258" "The Stone Prison is crushing you.  You are immobilized and your Defense is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2648729445" "Your {PowerName} crushes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduce his Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2911945440" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Salt Crystals 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3437809167" "Salt Crystals"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2796164971" "PBAoE, Foe Sleep, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3493553845" "Attempts to encrust all nearby foes in a Pillar of Salt. The victims will remain encased within the salt for quite a while, but will automatically break free if attacked. Affected targets have reduced defense for a while, even if they break free. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2772611963" "Sleep, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1655816027" "The Salt Crystals have rendered you Unconscious and reduced your Defense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fossilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1486930030" "Fossilize"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2785664101" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Hold, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P4150680328" "Encases a single target within solid stone. The stone slowly crushes the victim, dealing Smashing damage. The Fossilized victim is held helpless and unable to defend himself. You must have Stone Prison or Salt Crystals before selecting this power. Damage, Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2471844614" "Hold, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1601731162" "You have been Fossilized.  You cannot move and your Defense is reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stalagmites 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P619119382" "Stalagmites"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3932038330" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe -DEF, Minor Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P2853330292" "You can cause Stalagmites to erupt all around an enemy, slicing all nearby foes. The Stalagmites deal Lethal damage, and reduce the affected targets Defense. Some affected foes may be Disorient for a short while. You must be on the ground  to activate this power. You must have two other Earth Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P788279074" "Disorient, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4035017287" "You have been Disoriented and your Defenses have been reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2242740495" "Your {PowerName} pierce {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduce his Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2822304705" "{PlayerSource} pierces you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduces your defense!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Brute_Soul_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1724566754" "Soul Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2339177401" "Ghost Widow has granted you access to the power of darkness and souls. She has shown you how to use the souls of your victims to destroy your enemies. This has granted you access to powers and abilities you have never had before."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Gloom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3488406895" "Gloom"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P989391228" "Ranged, High DoT(Negative), Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P839873235" "Gloom slowly drains a target of life, while reducing his Accuracy. Slower than Dark Blast, but deals more damage over time. Damage: High(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1507726705" "DoT(Negative), -ACC"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3561705469" "The Gloom is causing damage to you and reducing your Accuracy."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2165607468" "Your {PowerName} drains {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2034897495" "{PlayerSource} drains you for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Tentacles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3945604315" "Soul Tentacles"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1122427135" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P792486038" "You can create a cone shaped rift to the Netherworld that allows the souls of the damned to slip into our reality. These Soul Tentacles will snare all foes within range, Immobilizing them while they drain their life. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P368684123" "Immobilize"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4031354083" "The Soul Tentacles are immobilizing you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Obliteration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P663035305" "Dark Obliteration"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2488273493" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P3377894206" "You hurl a large blast of negative energy that violently explodes on impact, exposing the dark power of the Netherworld to all foes near the target. Dark Obliteration can reduce the Accuracy of all affected targets. You must have Gloom or Soul Tentacles before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P966793536" "You hit {PlayerDest} with {Damage} points of smashing damage from your {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Widow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1280934609" "Summon Widow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P320003152" "Summon Blood Widow: Melee Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P728415780" "Ghost Widow has assigned a beautiful but deadly Blood Widow assassins for you to command. Their weapons of choice include wrist retractable mounted razors and darts, all tipped in deadly poison. Your access to this Blood Widow is very limited, and you can only summon her once every 15 minutes and she will leave after 4 minutes, until defeated, or until you leave a zone or mission. You must have two other Soul Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Stalker_Soul_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3832565559" "A long range blast of dark energy. Deals moderate Negative Energy damage and reduces the target's Accuracy. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3785880809" "The Dark Blast has reduced your Accuracy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Moonbeam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3845271994" "Moonbeam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1080025527" "Sniper, Superior DMG(Negative), Target -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P3524274026" "An extremely long range and accurate beam of Negative Energy that deals tremendous damage and reduces the target's Accuracy. This is a sniper attack, and like most sniper attacks, is best fired from a distance as it can be interrupted. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3277401711" "The Moonbeam has reduced your Accuracy."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3093485595" "You snipe {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce his accuracy!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1563061927" "{PlayerSource} snipes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce your accuracy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1796648775" "Soul Storm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1048474847" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Negative), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2479978172" "Like Ghost Widow, you can summon the souls of your victims to do your bidding.  Soul Storm enraptures a single target Holding them while their life-force is drained from their body. You must have Dark Blast or Moonbeam before selecting this power. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P337683231" "Hold DoT(Negative)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2995608826" "You are being Held by a Soul Storm.  You are taking negative Damage over time as your life is drained."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1318451308" "Your {PowerName} drains {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Negative Energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1879160615" "{PowerName} drains you for {Damage} points of Negative Energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Widow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4064831947" "Summon Night Widow: Melee Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3460425657" "Ghost Widow has assigned a Night Widow for you to command.  Night Widows are trained in stealth, infiltration, disguise, and cold-blooded murder. Most of their victims never even see them coming.  Your access to this Night Widow is very limited. You can only summon her once every 15 minutes and she will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Soul Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Corruptor_Soul_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Drain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1131046375" "Using this power, you can drain the essence of all nearby foes' souls, thus increasing your own strength. Each affected foe will lose some Hit Points and add to your Damage and Accuracy. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3393332929" "{PlayerSource} drains {Damage} points of life from you."
// DisplayFloat :
"P111359259" "Scourge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Embrace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P312009320" "You tap into the energy of the Netherworld to protect yourself from damage. This Dark Embrace shrouds you and grants resistance to Lethal, Smashing, Negative Energy and Toxic damage. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P604640449" "Like Ghost Widow, you can summon the souls of your victims to do your bidding.  Soul Storm enraptures a single target Holding them while their life-force is drained from their body. You must have Soul Drain or Dark Embrace before selecting this power. Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Mistress 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P944562137" "Summon Mistress"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3663361456" "Summon Fortunata Mistress: Ranged Moderate DMG(Psionic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P418242616" "Ghost Widow has assigned a Fortunata Mistress for you to command.  Arguably, the most powerful of the Fortunatas, these rare few have mastered numerous psychic abilities and risen to the top of Lord Recluse's beautiful Black Widows. Your access to this Fortunata is very limited. You can only summon her once every 15 minutes and she will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Soul Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
