// Power Set : Dominator_Soul_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Consumption 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Embrace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Obliteration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3401573784" "You hurl a large blast of negative energy that violently explodes on impact, exposing the dark power of the Netherworld to all foes near the target. Dark Obliteration can reduce the Accuracy of all affected targets. You must have Dark Consumption or Dark Embrace before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Seer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3281898715" "Summon Seer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P525223622" "Summon Fortunata Seer: Ranged Moderate DMG(Psionic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1190534696" "Ghost Widow has assigned a Fortunata Seer for you to command.  Fortunata Seers can glimpse moments into the future. They use this ability to increase the Perception of their teammate. Your access to this Fortunata Seer is very limited. You can only summon her once every 15 minutes and she will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Soul Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mastermind_Soul_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Night Fall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3659140167" "Night Fall"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4168618399" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P2061443154" "Unleashes a cone shaped burst of particles from the Netherworld. All targets within the modest range of this power take Negative Energy damage and have a reduced Accuracy. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3657573609" "Night Fall has reduced your Accuracy."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3064660140" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce his accuracy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Embrace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Tentacles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3933404757" "You can create a cone shaped rift to the Netherworld that allows the souls of the damned to slip into our reality. These Soul Tentacles will snare all foes within range, Immobilizing them while they drain their life. You must have Night Fall or Dark Embrace before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soul Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3978022474" "Like Ghost Widow, you can summon the souls of your victims to do your bidding.  Soul Storm enraptures a single target Holding them while their life-force is drained from their body. You must have two other Soul Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Slow"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Brute_Mace_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1468440306" "Mace Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3219938166" "Black Scorpion has granted you access to the advanced technology of the Executioner's Mace. The signature weapon of the Bane Spider Executioner, it is not a typical clumsy mace. The Executioner's Mace is capable of firing a variety of energy projectiles and grenades.  It can even be modified to summon and command some or Black Scorpions RV technologies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mace Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P171756856" "Mace Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3070966037" "Ranged, Heavy DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1823527145" "The Executioner's Mace is capable of firing a powerful bolt of kinetic energy. The blast is powerful enough that it may knock down some foes. Arachnos Bane Spider Troopers call this the Power Blast. The Arbiters who invented it scoff at this simple term. Damage: Heavy, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P90837049" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P482297281" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Envelope 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1402461231" "Web Envelope"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4011995531" "Ranged (Targeted AoE) Immobilize, -Recharge, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P1757844943" "The Executioner's Mace can lob a modified Web Grenade.  Upon impact, the Web Grenade expels a strong, tenuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets in a wide area. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is Slowed. The Web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3505771407" "Immobilize, -Fly, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1730420478" "You have been caught in a web.  You cannot move or fly and your attack speed is reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disruptor Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2464121079" "Disruptor Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2290561359" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Smashing/Energy), Foe -Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P181327360" "Fires a tremendous charge of kinetic energy from your Executioner's Mace. This charge is so powerful it will explode on impact, blasting all nearby foes.  Some affected foes may be knocked down by the force of the blast. You must have Mace Blast or Web Envelope before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Blaster 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3381607634" "Summon Blaster"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2832651078" "Summon Arachnobot: Ranged Moderate DMG(Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1915164964" "Black Scorpion has granted you an Arachnobot Blaster for you to command. Arachnobot Blasters were created by Arachnos Orb Weavers to take down particularly powerful super-powered threats. Your access to this Arachnobot is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes and it will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Mace Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Stalker_Mace_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayHelp :
"P3558498840" "Black Scorpion has granted you access to the advanced technology of the Nullifier Mace. The signature weapon of the Bane Spider Commandos, it is not a typical clumsy mace. The Bane Mace is capable of firing a variety of energy projectiles and grenades.  It can even be modified to summon and command some or Black Scorpions RV technologies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mace Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1588737777" "The Bane Mace is capable of firing a bolt of kinetic energy. The blast is powerful enough that it may knock down some foes. Arachnos Bane Spider Troopers call this the Power Blast. The Arbiters who invented it scoff at this simple term. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mace Beam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3336005936" "Mace Beam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3159257085" "Sniper, Superior DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P898330598" "Fires an extremely long range and accurate beam of kinetic Energy from the Bane Mace that deals tremendous damage and knocks back the target. This is a sniper attack, and like most sniper attacks, is best fired from a distance as it can be interrupted. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2306810191" "You snipe {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1193480974" "{PlayerSource} snipes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1575201275" "You snipe {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1403521438" "{PlayerSource} snipes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Cocoon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1125963887" "Web Cocoon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2654014527" "Ranged, Foe Hold, -Recharge, -Fly, Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P3419942313" "The Bane Mace can fire a more powerful version the common web grenade.  The sinewy fibers of this grenade are strong enough to completely Hold one target. Targets able to resist the Hold are still likely to have their attack and movement speed dramatically slowed.  Web Cocoon can also bring down flying targets and prevent foes from jumping. You must have Mace Blast or Mace before selecting this power. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P827831154" "Hold, -Fly, -Recharge, Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2037126325" "You have been caught in a Web Cocoon and are Held.  You cannot move or fly and your attack and movement speed is reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Spiderlings 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2801443794" "Summon Spiderlings"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3285511783" "Summon Spiderlings: Ranged Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P420507927" "Black Scorpion has granted you access to a small squadron of Arachnobot Spiderlings. Three Spiderlings that are one level less than you will show up when summoned. Your access to these Arachnobots is very limited. You can only summon them once every 15 minutes and they will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Mace Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Corruptor_Mace_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Envelope 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Scorpion Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2874341642" "Scorpion Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1725054828" "Toggle: Self, +Def(Smash, Lethal), +Res(Energy/Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1012625809" "Black Scorpions technologies are impressive indeed.  This energy shield grants you Defense to Lethal, Smashing and Energy attacks, as well as improve your damage resistance to Toxic damage. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P562105923" "Your {PowerName} protects you from lethal, smashing, Toxic and energy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Cocoon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3191418375" "The Bane Mace can fire a more powerful version the common web grenade.  The sinewy fibers of this grenade are strong enough to completely Hold one target. Targets able to resist the Hold are still likely to have their attack and movement speed dramatically slowed.  Web Cocoon can also bring down flying targets and prevent foes from jumping. You must have Web Envelope or Scorpion Shield before selecting this power. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Disruptor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3743136785" "Summon Disruptor"
// Power Help Text :
"P2454893152" "Black Scorpion has granted you an Arachnobot Disruptor for you to command. Arachnobots were created by Arachnos Orb Weavers to take down particularly powerful super-powered threats. Your access to this Arachnobot is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes and it will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Mace Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Dominator_Mace_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poisonous Ray 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P775034031" "Poisonous Ray"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P48792747" "Ranged DoT(Poison), Foe -RES, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P373009646" "The Bane Mace can five a nasty Poison Ray.  This toxin is suspended in a polarized plasma field and delivered like an energy blast.  Upon impact, the toxin directly attacks the immune system, reducing the affected targets Defense and Damage Resistance as it teals toxic damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2240527002" "DoT(Poison), -RES, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3505122819" "Your Defense and Damage Resistances have been reduced.  You are taking toxic damage over time."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3205652590" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces his defense and damage resistance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3500386142" "{PlayerSource} blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage with a {PowerName} and reduces your defense and damage resistance."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P993627107" "The {PowerName} continues to deal {Damage} points of Toxic damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1195407783" "You continue to take {Damage} points of Toxic damage from the {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Scorpion Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disruptor Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1289912448" "Fires a tremendous charge of kinetic energy from your Bane Mace. This charge is so powerful it will explode on impact, blasting all nearby foes.  Some affected foes may be knocked down by the force of the blast. You must have Poisonous Ray or Scorpion Shield before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Tarantula 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3037255610" "Summon Tarantula"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2979234735" "Summon Tarantula: Ranged Moderate DMG(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1665018027" "Black Scorpion has granted you an Toxic Tarantula for you to command. Weaver One developed the Tarantula Exoskeleton Armor, which so radically transforms an Arachnos troop that hardly anything human is recognizable. Your access to this Tarantula is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes and it will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Mace Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mastermind_Mace_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayHelp :
"P789612177" "Black Scorpion has granted you access to the advanced technology of the Nullifier Mace. The signature weapon of the Wolf Spider TacOps troops, it is not a typical clumsy mace. The Nullifier Mace is capable of firing a variety of energy projectiles and grenades.  It can even be modified to summon and command some or Black Scorpions RV technologies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Envelope 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2896080951" "The Nullifier Mace can lob a modified Web Grenade.  Upon impact, the Web Grenade expels a strong, tenuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets in a wide area. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is Slowed. The Web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Scorpion Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mace Beam Volley 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2103519298" "Mace Beam Volley"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P623976523" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Smashing/Energy), Foe -Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3066070182" "Fires a volley of multiple kinetic energy blasts from your Nullifier Mace. These blast spread out in a wide cone and are powerful enough to knock down some foes. You must have Web Envelope or Scorpion Shield before selecting this power.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Cocoon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P688436411" "The Bane Mace can fire a more powerful version the common web grenade.  The sinewy fibers of this grenade are strong enough to completely Hold one target. Targets able to resist the Hold are still likely to have their attack and movement speed dramatically slowed.  Web Cocoon can also bring down flying targets and prevent foes from jumping. You must have Web Envelope or Web Cocoon before selecting this power. You must have two other Mace Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Brute_Leviathan_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3487560968" "Leviathan Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P682796664" "Captain Mako has granted you access to the power of the Leviathan. The Leviathan is an ancient gargantuan entity who slumbers under Sharkhead Isle.  Worshiped by the Coralax, the Leviathan has given Captain Mako many abilities and now he has taught you how to harness its power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spirit Shark 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3804756563" "Spirit Shark"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1608306014" "Ranged, Heavy DoT(Lethal), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3133195311" "You are empowered with Spirit of the Mako Shark. You can project this spirit to attack and mauls your opponent. The Shark Spirit Energy will manifest and attack your foe, quickly dealing heavy lethal damage over time. Damage: Heavy(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3278563378" "DoT(Lethal)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P861697510" "You are being mauled by a Spirit Shark."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3563209869" "You attack {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3781150608" "{PlayerSource} attacks you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1641961306" "{PowerName} continues to maul {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4105226672" "{PowerName} continues to maul you for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : School of Sharks 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1701467337" "School of Sharks"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2597470195" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DoT(Negative), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P3761741922" "You can call forth a school of vicious Shark Spirits that will swim out in a cone formation and will encircle your foes, draining their spirit energy. The encircling Shark Spirits will immobilize most foes while they deal negative energy damage over time. Both you and the target must be Near the Ground for this power to activate. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P444445179" "Immobilize, DoT(Negative)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3149058435" "The School of Sharks has Immobilized you, inflicting negative Damage over Time."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2616467189" "You attack {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2261543782" "{PlayerSource} attacks you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P195741080" "{PowerName} continues to drain {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1436358105" "{PowerName} continues to drain you for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chum Spray 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1845983817" "Chum Spray"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2486653415" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DoT(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3076348779" "Sharks will eat anything, so their stomach acid must be powerful indeed. You can regurgitate this acid and spew a corrosive spray of bile at a foe. Affected foes in the cone are will take toxic damage over time. You must have Spirit Shark or School of Sharks before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1861415682" "DoT (Toxic)"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4293173146" "{PlayerSource} drowns you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2151914180" "{PlayerSource} deals an additional {Damage} points of toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Guardian 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2939588278" "Summon Guardian"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1766882520" "Summon Sentinel: Ranged Moderate DMG(Smashing)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2219466741" "Captain Mako has shown you how to summon a Coralax Guardian Sentinel to do your bidding. These creatures are composed of living coral made from the sea-goddess Merulina. Your access to this Guardian is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes and it will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Leviathan Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Stalker_Leviathan_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spirit Shark 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1810306288" "You are empowered with Spirit of the Mako Shark. You can project this spirit to attack and mauls your opponent. The Shark Spirit Energy will manifest and attack your foe, quickly dealing heavy lethal damage over time. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Water Spout 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P522145595" "Water Spout"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1058426395" "Summon Water Spout: PBAoE Minor DAM (Smash), Foe Knockback, Fear, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P3744165951" "Conjures up a Water Spout at a targeted location. The Water Spout will chase down your foes, tossing them into the air and hurling them great distances. The victims are left Disoriented and with reduced Defense. The Water Spout is a menacing sight, and can even cause panic among your foes. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spirit Shark Jaws 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2112707731" "Spirit Shark Jaws"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3608719476" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Lethal), Foe Hold, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P4148305792" "You can summon a massive Spirit Shark that will attack your foe from below.  The Shark will grip your foe with its massive jaws and attempt to hold the target while it mauls it, dealing lethal Damage over Time. Flying Targets will likely be pulled to the ground. You must have Spirit Shark or Water Spout before selecting this power. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3467685239" "Hold, DoT(Lethal)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1638909038" "You are being Held by a Spirit Shark Jaws and are taking lethal Damage over Time as you are Mauled."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Guardian 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2549874370" "Summon Warder: Ranged Moderate DMG(Smashing)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2777630817" "Captain Mako has shown you how to summon a Coralax Guardian Warder to do your bidding. These creatures are composed of living coral made from the sea-goddess Merulina. Your access to this Guardian is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes and it will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Leviathan Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

