// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Brute_Mu_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P219921951" "Mu Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3023468194" "Scirocco has taught you the ancient powers of the Mu. In their eternal struggle against the Oranbega, the Mu have unlocked many mystical powers, including their very signature crimson lightning.  Now you posses these their secrets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mu Lightning 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4034968973" "Mu Lightning"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1519530153" "Ranged, High DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P412115573" "You can send a large blast of Mu electrical energy at a foe, dealing heavy damage and draining some Endurance. Some of this Endurance may transfer back to you. Damage: High, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1222602885" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some Endurance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3785759185" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some of your Endurance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Electrifying Fences 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3988822156" "Electrifying Fences"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3493670038" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Energy), Foe Immobilize, -END"
// Power Help Text :
"P2783899540" "The Electrifying Fences attempts to Immobilize a group of foes in an area. This power deals some energy damage over time as it slowly drains some Endurance. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3778609849" "Immobilize, DoT(Negative), -END"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4024297128" "You are immobilized by the Electrifying Fences. You are taking energy damage over time and are loosing some Endurance."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P167943309" "Your {PowerName} electrocutes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some Endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P679857827" "{PlayerSource} electrocutes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some of your Endurance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ball Lightning 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2138267515" "Ball Lightning"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P256474272" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P214850306" "Hurls a highly charged ball of Mu lightning that explodes on contact. Ball Lightning deals good damage in an area of effect, and drains some Endurance from each target it hits. You must have Mu Lightning or Electrifying Fences before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1831456333" "DoT(Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2467806480" "The Ball Lightning is continuing to electrocute you."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P115594690" "Your {PowerName} deals an additional {Damage} points of energy damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1304278633" "{PowerName} continues to electrocute you for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Striker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3896350138" "Summon Striker"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P957037479" "Summon Mu Strike: Ranged Moderate DMG(Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1680326923" "Scirocco has shown you how to call upon a mystical Mu Striker to assist you. The Mu pulse with the blood of their slaughtered ancestors in their veins, and are well practiced in the dark arts. Your access to this Striker is very limited. You can only summon him once every 15 minutes and he will leave after 4 minutes, or if you exit a zone or mission. You must have two other Mu Mastery Powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Stalker_Mu_Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mu Bolts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3970085027" "Mu Bolts"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1298334033" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1454699080" "You can quickly hurl small bolts of Mu electricity at foes, dealing some damage and draining some Endurance. Some of this Endurance may transfer back to you. Mu Bolts deals light damage but recharges quickly. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Zapp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3017513223" "Zapp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P722481217" "Sniper, Extreme DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3336155057" "A focused blast of Mu electrical energy that can travel great distances with high Accuracy. Zapp drains Endurance, and is best fired from a distance, as it can be interrupted. Some of the Endurance you drain may transfer back to you. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P709844447" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some endurance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1805877043" "{PlayerSource} Zapps you for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some of your Endurance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Electric Shackles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1547907555" "Electric Shackles"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2228407903" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Energy), Foe Hold, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2143607869" "Electric Shackles binds a foes limbs, leaving the target held and helpless. The target is drained of some Endurance and some of that Endurance may be transferred back to you. You must have Mu Bolts or Zapp before selecting this power. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3665437929" "The Electric Shackles are holding you helpless."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2444723527" "You electrocute {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some Endurance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2132975202" "{PlayerSource} electrocute you for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some of your Endurance!"

