"P2568792210" "Auto: Self +Res (Energy, Negative)"
// Power Help Text :
"P950412167" "Kheldians have a natural mild resistance to Energy and Negative Energy damage. This Auto power is always on and costs no Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
