// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P452623407" "Self Heal, +Max HP, Res (Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3164596223" "You can activate this power to increase your maximum Hit Points for a short time. Essence Boost also grants you resistance to Toxic Damage. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2226385479" "You {PowerName} and increase your maximum Hit Points."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
