"P336156689" "Quantum Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2119377510" "Toggle: Self +Res(Energy, Negative)"
// Power Help Text :
"P670082185" "When you toggle on Quantum Shield, you become highly resistant to Energy and Negative damage. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P943910055" "Your {PowerName} has made you highly resistant to energy and negative damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Group Energy Flight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1216681671" "Group Energy Flight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P426498402" "Toggle: Team Fly, -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P2223917402" "You can endow your nearby teammates with Flight. Be mindful! Your friends will fall if you run out of Endurance or if they travel too far away from you. Group Energy Flight travel speed is slower than Energy Flight. Flying heroes suffer from reduced Accuracy."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P462052480" "You grant {PlayerDest} the power the Flight!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2461148565" "{PlayerSource} endows you with Flight! Stay close or you will fall!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3156923765" "-ACC, Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2610848162" "You are granted the ability to fly, however your Accuracy is reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : White Dwarf 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1436347276" "White Dwarf"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2162812352" "Toggle: Shapeshift, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P50529227" "Kheldians are masters of energy and matter.  A Peacebringer can transform into a massive unstoppable energy beast known as a White Dwarf.  When you choose this power, you will have access to 6 other powers that can only be used while in this form. You will not be able to use any other powers while in White Dwarf form. White Dwarf has awesome resistance to all damage except Psionics, as well as controlling effects.  White Dwarf also has improved HP and Endurance Recovery, but is limited to melee attacks.  Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Reform Essence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3202946730" "Reform Essence"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1324952732" "Self Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P4002351686" "Through perfect control of your body and energy, you can concentrate for a few moments and heal yourself. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P454249131" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} hit points!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Conserve Energy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1469199121" "Conserve Energy"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P4206863299" "You can focus for a moment to Conserve your Energy. After activating this power, you expend less Endurance on all other powers for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P449250572" "Your concentrate and Conserve your Energy.  Your powers now cost less Endurance for a while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Quantum Flight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3368905975" "Quantum Flight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2596392736" "Toggle: Self Fly, Intangible"
// Power Help Text :
"P1026290564" "You shift your quantum matrix and become more energy than matter. No longer bound by the laws of normal physics, you become intangible to other entities and can fly at high speeds. You cannot maintain your Intangible nature for long. After about 45 seconds, all your powers will start to cost more and more Endurance until you deactivate Quantum Flight. Quantum Flight grants some stealth and is faster than normal Flight, but its Endurance Cost is higher. You cannot affect other targets while Quantum Flight is active."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Restore Essence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P530349857" "Restore Essence"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1762744290" "Self Rez"
// Power Help Text :
"P1157939255" "Should you fall in battle, you can Restore your Essence and bring yourself from the brink of death. You will revive with most of your Hit Points and half your Endurance and be protected from XP Debt for 20 seconds. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1697561617" "You {PowerName} yourself from the brink of death.  You feel weak and cannot do anything for a while."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P345555159" "+XP Debt Protection"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P609977609" "You have Restored your Essence. You are protected from XP Debt for 20 seconds."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Light Form 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2000158265" "Light Form"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2832362132" "Self, +Res(Disorient, Sleep, Hold, Immobilize, All DMG but Psionics)"
// Power Help Text :
"P959247951" "When you activate Light Form, you become pure Kheldian energy and are extremely resistant to most damage. You are also partially protected from some Disorient, Immobilization, Hold, and Sleep effects. Endurance recovery is also increased. While in Light Form, you cannot shape shift into Bright Nova or White Dwarf form. Light Form costs little Endurance to activate, but when it wears off you are left exhausted, and drained of almost all Hit Points and Endurance. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2647358892" "Your Light Form has made you highly resistant to most attacks."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3647161610" "Changing into a Light Form has left you exhausted."

