"P2769547729" "Proton Scatter sends bolts of Kheldian energy to multiple targets at once within a cone area in front of the caster.  Proton Scatter deals moderate Energy damage to each affected target and reduces their Defense.  Damage: Moderate. Recharge: Slow"
