// Power Help Text :
"P434140451" "You can hurl Gravimetric fibers to Snare your foes.  Gravimetric Snare can Immobilize a singe target and crush him.  The target's attack rate and movement speed are also slowed, even if he resists the Immobilization effect. Damage: Moderate Damage over time, Recharge: Fast"
