// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Nova 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3668171698" "Dark Nova"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P304894607" "Kheldians are masters of energy and matter.  A Warshade can transform into a flying energy beast known as a Dark Nova.  When you choose this power, you will have access to 4 very powerful ranged attacks that can only be used while in this form. You will not be able to use any other powers while in Dark Nova form. Dark Nova can fly, has increased Accuracy, and improved Endurance Recovery but has no defense.  Recharge: Fast"

