"P2333715870" "Gravity Well"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2988903557" "Melee, Superior DMG(Negative), Foe Immobilize, -Recharge, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P1401867720" "Mastery over the forces of gravity and dark matter allows you to capture a single foe and crush him in a Gravity Well.  The target is Held helpless, while he is crushed by the massive gravimetric forces. The target's attack rate and movement speed are also slowed, even if he resists the Hold effect. Damage: Superior(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
