"P3770236974" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -Recharge, -SPD; Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P1749816274" "You tap the primal forces of your Nictus power to create an Essence Draining conduit between a foe and yourself. This will transfer Hit Points from your enemy to you. Foes drained in this manner have their attack rate and movement speed reduced. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
