// Power : Unchain Essence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2044560053" "Unchain Essence"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P682208060" "Ranged (Targeted AoE Special), Superior DMG(Negative), Foe Disorient, Knockback, -Recharge, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P1661329680" "The Warshade can release the energy of a defeated foe and cause a massive Negative Energy explosion that can devastate any remaining foes. This power can only be activated by targeting a defeated foe. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P698183903" "You have been Disoriented by the Unchain Essence attack.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are reduced as well."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2869756380" "You blast {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and slow him by unleashing the essence of your defeated foe."
